[{"client_msg_id":"053cb8f9-4380-4f54-8b81-9bc2685b31f4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今日の夜Among Usやりたいんだけど参加できる方いらっしゃいますか？","ts":"1620121675.258700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=a8Xw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e33fcee8-03c5-4039-822c-9d083b5a371e","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"星ってもう12年前か...","ts":"1620119577.257600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8sX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1eea7a45-8f08-49b1-a5a9-a153b72bb962","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"自分も東方は星で最後でした。星lunaクリア出来なくて折れてしまった...","ts":"1620119555.257300","edited":{"user":"U01J7703PFT","ts":"1620119704.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AFys"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C246AC3D-1E99-4894-A642-ABD4B2F7FDA7","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"東方もう10年くらい追っかけてないな\n最後にやったのがティンクルスタースプライツのオマージュのやつだっけか","ts":"1620119426.256800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t3i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"054b5dde-dbe1-484e-afe3-dd56a4c30609","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"そういえば軸合わせの仕様もあったんだったね。忘れてた","ts":"1620119412.256400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+w6="}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb607a81-8f79-4dd1-a7fb-b5257ed4de7f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"紅魔郷は軸合わせにいかないといけないし普通のシューティングでむずい","ts":"1620119352.254100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OmJPv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a759621-d102-4339-88c5-ddddc79f0c65","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"妖々夢以降はボスが軸合わせに来てくれるんですよね","ts":"1620119336.253500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TuyU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ee899e4-2890-4b23-a674-9c0d6f847bfc","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"弾幕STGは辛いですよね。自分は死にゲーけっこう好きだったんで好きなジャンルなんですけど\nまあ人口増えにくいというのは理解出来てしまう...","ts":"1620119328.253200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wISo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ED239913-1DE6-4BA2-90A4-F1BB3B73D66A","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"CAVEは家庭用コンソールから事実上撤退しちゃったのが残念ですねえ\nまだエムツーが頑張っている感はあるけれど、ジャンル的には先行きがけっこうきびしい","ts":"1620119274.252000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JFw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a489026-c07f-42be-be71-edd7f688084b","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"紅は弾幕的には割とマシなんだけど、残機とかボムが少なかったからシステムでゴリ押し出来なくて\nガチ勝負になるところがキツかった気がする","ts":"1620119273.251900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HK65"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95e4f23f-0f97-4507-8735-68256e8d1509","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"ケイブシューもけっこうやりたかったんですけど、あんまり家庭用出て無くて断念した思い出","ts":"1620119183.248500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NiOs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"205CB638-EC09-4C02-8330-D19A6B4B9B35","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"紅めちゃくちゃむずいイメージ","ts":"1620119165.247900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZUcbp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69ee9f57-a1b1-435b-833b-74a676ec14e1","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"自分は紅、妖、永、風、地はlunaクリアした。地は相当苦労した覚えが。","ts":"1620119142.247200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XEe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ADFBAA4-757F-47C2-B07F-ACFFCCBECF41","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"虫姫さまふたりのアレンジモードウルトラ難度はわりとやさしめ(処理落